- Madelung constant for CsCl (\( M(\text{CsCl}) \)) = 1.763
- Avogadro's number (\( N_A \)) = \( 6.022 \times 10^{23} \, \text{mol}^{-1} \)

### **Objective:**
Calculate the molar crystal energy (\(\Delta E_{\text{cryst}}\)) for CsCl in units of \( \text{J/mol} \).

